<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Так
оно и есть.<br />
<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>C</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Сегодня
я прощаюсь,<br />
<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                   
